# 4. Sabse powerful example: poor vs middle class aspiration

Creator ka ek major framework hai:

**Poor person middle class ko copy karta hai productivity ke liye.
Middle class rich ko copy karta hai vanity ke liye.**

### House-help example

Ek domestic worker dekhti hai ki employer ke paas washing machine hai.

Washing machine lene se:

* kapde manually dhone ka time bachta hai,
* woh extra ghar me kaam le sakti hai,
* income badh sakti hai.

Fridge lene se:

* food preparation frequency reduce hoti hai,
* time bachta hai,
* aur earning potential badh sakta hai.

Yaani consumption ne **productivity improve ki**.

### Middle-class version

Middle class rich person ko dekhkar copy karta hai:

* 5-star hotel
* flagship phone
* luxury car
* premium school
* extravagant vacation

Lekin in purchases se earning capacity ya free time zaroori nahi badhta.

Creator ka punchline:

**Rich logon ki vanity copy mat karo; unka leverage copy karo.**



