# 5. 5-star hotel example: experience se zyada “vasooli”

Creator humorous example deta hai ki middle-class family 1–2 din ke expensive resort stay me har minute ka paisa vasool karna chahti hai:

* buffet me everything try karna,
* har jagah photos,
* pool photos,
* food photos,
* luxury display,
* “we have arrived” feeling.

Meanwhile genuinely wealthy person comparatively relaxed ho sakta hai, kyunki uske liye experience financially extraordinary nahi hai.

Point: **Agar luxury purchase aapko relaxation dene ke bajaye performance pressure de rahi hai, toh luxury ne purpose hi defeat kar diya.**



