# 6. Social media ne comparison ka radius infinite kar diya

Pehle comparison limited tha:

* neighbour
* cousin
* relative
* “saadu”

Aaj Instagram ki wajah se duniya bhar ke log comparison set ban gaye.

Example:

Pehle husband birthday pe sari laata tha, wife genuinely happy hoti thi.

Aaj immediately comparison aa sakta hai:

*“Meri friend ke husband ne Maldives trip diya.”*

Creator kehta hai ki aapka competition ab real peer group se nahi, **curated highlight reels** se hai.

Solution: apni lane define karo.



