# 7. “I want the best” middle class ki dangerous disease

Creator repeatedly phrase use karta hai:

**“My child will get the best education.”**

Uske according “best” obsession financially destructive hai.

Expensive school = automatically best education nahi.

Woh Indian private schooling ko criticize karta hai ki often premium fees ka visible output hota hai:

* fancy infrastructure,
* English-speaking environment,
* presentation,
* annual functions,
* branding,

lekin necessarily superior teaching nahi.

Uska broader principle:

**“Best” afford karne ki race ke bajaye “good enough + financially sustainable” choose karo.**



