# 11. Promotion ko life victory mat samjho

Creator kehta hai corporate ladder har promotion ke baad aapko naye competence challenge me daalti hai.

Aap ek role me competent hue → promote hue → ab aisa kaam mila jo pehle nahi kiya → again prove yourself → more stress.

Uska objection promotion itself nahi, balki endless carrot chasing se hai.

Career ka ultimate question:

**“Main kitna title bada bana raha hoon?” nahi,
“Main kitna apna time control karta hoon?”**



