**Agar wife second child nahi chahti, toh kabhi-kabhi woh relationship experience par referendum ho sakta hai.**

Meaning: first pregnancy/childbirth ke dauran woman ko respect, recovery, support aur comfort itna milna chahiye ki second pregnancy ka thought trauma na lage.



