# 14. Postpartum support aur older-generation comparison ki criticism

Creator strongly criticize karta hai:

*“Hum toh delivery ke teesre din roti bana rahe the.”*

Uska point:

Purani generation ki hardship ko **standard of virtue** mat banao.

Agar aaj family afford kar sakti hai:

* domestic help,
* professional postpartum caregiver,
* childcare support,
* rest,
* medical care,

toh use karna “sanskar ki kami” nahi.

Woh saas-bahu cycle ko slavery analogy se explain karta hai:

> suffering person ki fantasy freedom nahi, kabhi-kabhi “meri turn kab aayegi authority ki” ban jaati hai.

Creator ka preferred model:

**“Mere saath jo galat hua, woh meri bahu ke saath nahi hoga.”**



