# 15. C-section, hospitals aur IVF par creator ke strong claims

Creator hospitals par allegation lagata hai ki India me financial incentives kabhi unnecessary C-sections encourage kar sakte hain, aur private healthcare metrics/charges middle-class pressure increase kar rahe hain.

Woh suggest karta hai ki delivery pricing ko procedure-neutral banana chahiye taaki hospital ko C-section se extra financial incentive na mile.

**Important:** yeh creator ke allegations/opinions hain; transcript me in claims ke liye medical evidence establish nahi kiya gaya. Individual delivery decisions medical indications par depend karte hain.

Similarly IVF ke context me creator ka argument hai ki kaafi log late 30s tak marriage/children delay karte hain aur baad me fertility treatment ki difficulty face karte hain. Woh earlier family planning ko safer option ke roop me advocate karta hai, though transcript ke specific fertility claims ko independent verification nahi diya gaya. 

