# 16. Late marriage ko creator career sequencing problem maanta hai

Creator ka reasoning:

Agar aap 20s me marriage/family complete kar lete ho, toh 30s ke career peak me comparatively uninterrupted run mil sakta hai.

Whereas:

* 20s purely career,
* 30s me marriage search,
* pregnancy,
* childcare,

toh professional peak aur family-building overlap kar sakte hain.

Woh particularly urban marriage market ke examples deta hai jahan high salary expectations, delayed matching, parental disengagement aur aging parents complication create kar dete hain.



