# 17. Parents bhi marriage ka positive case explain nahi karte

Creator ka interesting psychological point:

Kai daughters bachpan se mothers ko marriage ke against complain karte sunti hain:

* saas ne yeh kiya,
* husband ne yeh kiya,
* life kharab ho gayi,
* financially dependent mat rehna.

Phir same parent age 27 par bolta hai:

*“Shaadi kar lo.”*

Naturally child poochta hai: **kyun?**

Creator kehta hai parents rarely honestly communicate:

* companionship,
* intimacy,
* sexuality,
* family,
* children,
* shared life,
* emotional security

ke positive sides.

Isliye next generation ko institution ka mainly negative trailer mila.



