## Additional “bonus” advice

### Degrees blindly accumulate mat karo

Degree ≠ practical wisdom.

Focus also on:

* financial knowledge,
* relationships,
* happiness,
* decision-making,
* practical competence.

---

### Sadness ko secondary suffering mat banao

Creator ka psychology point:

Sad hona natural hai.

Problem hoti hai:

**“Main sad kyun hoon? Mere saath hi kyun?”**

Primary pain + pain ke against resistance = larger suffering.

---

### Burnout mat karo: sprinter nahi, cross-country runner bano

Life ko marathon/test match treat karo.

* slow periods okay,
* pause okay,
* crawl okay,
* but direction important.

Aircraft/runway analogy:

Pilot immediate nose ke neeche nahi, distance/horizon dekhkar alignment karta hai.

Likewise career ka 10–20 year direction dekho.

---

### Titles aur status ke peeche life mat waste karo

Creator military/government designations ka humorous example deta hai.

Core message:

Aapka designation outside your institutional environment utna meaningful nahi hota.

Chess analogy:

> Game khatam hone ke baad king aur pawn same box me jaate hain.

Choose **wellness, autonomy and meaningful work** over status addiction.

---

### “Average life” ko failure mat samjho

Creator ka final philosophical point:

Instagram ne exceptional life ko minimum standard bana diya.

But:

* normal house,
* decent marriage,
* children,
* enough income,
* health,
* peace

itself a major achievement ho sakta hai.

**“Average but fulfilled” > “exceptional-looking but restless.”**



