# Marriage, Children & Fulfilment: Creator ka final worldview

Creator openly traditional/pro-family position leta hai.

Uska conclusion hai:

**House + marriage + children ko unnecessarily intellectually complicated mat karo.**

Uske according 30s struggle-heavy ho sakte hain, lekin 40s me family ek strong sense of creation aur continuity de sakti hai:

*“Main physically slow ho raha hoon, but something I created is growing.”*

Woh pets ko child substitute ke roop me bhi discuss karta hai aur loneliness ko future “pandemic” jaisa economic/social opportunity aur problem predict karta hai.

Again, yeh **creator ka worldview** hai—not a universal prescription for every individual. 

