# Women, Work & Domestic Labour par important discussion

Video ke end me host poochta hai ki women financially independent hone ki strong need kyun feel karti hain, even jab modest salary ke against childcare/maid costs large ho sakte hain.

Creator iska blame primarily previous-generation men par rakhta hai.

Uska argument:

Women ko decades tak sunaya gaya:

**“Tum paise nahi kamati.”**

Isliye earning dignity/independence ka symbol ban gayi—even when salary economically optimal na ho.

Creator kehta hai:

* earning husband ka work valuable hai,
* household-running wife ka work bhi valuable hai,
* ek role ko great bolne ke liye doosre ko inferior karna zaroori nahi.

Ideal model:

**Team discussion: kaun kya kare, family economics kya hai, childcare ka best arrangement kya hai, kis role me overall household welfare maximum hai.**

Postpartum period me woman ke sacrifice ko actively recognize aur reward karne ki bhi strong advocacy karta hai. 

