Video ke final controversial section me creator predict karta hai ki India me **average women ka relative advantage marriage/work market me reduce ho sakta hai**, reasons ke roop me woh cite karta hai:

* younger cohorts me changing sex ratios,
* difficult job market,
* female career independence ka normalization,
* “first woman to…” novelty ka decline,
* gender expectations ka gradually level hona.

Important nuance: woh men ko explicitly warn karta hai ki women ki situation difficult hone par **celebrate mat karo**; uske according healthy society me women ka downfall male victory nahi hona chahiye.

